  "scope": "Own tiny split-v2 models in published Go SDK 0.2.9: sixteen real SDK child calls, twelve predictions, twenty-four selected finite cases and thirty attempted case evaluations. Eight full-contract bodies complete with three added candidates; three sparse bodies disagree with the intended subtraction. One reused intention, no new training. Context facts differ from training text. Original-file binding and native main adoption are pending; native/emitted-Go calls are zero. Core weights/card and earlier appendices unchanged. Packaging and independent Go arithmetic verification make no new model/process calls."
}
